      "question": "In supply chain management, what is the 'bullwhip effect'?\n\nDemand Variability:\nCust->Retailer->Wholesaler->Manuf.\n<--| | | |-->\nSmall fluctuations at the consumer end can cause increasingly larger fluctuations as you move up the supply chain.",
